function Planner({household}){const[tasks,setTasks]=useState([]);const[members,setMembers]=useState([]);const[filter,setFilter]=useState('today');const[msg,setMsg]=useState('');const[form,setForm]=useState({title:'',assigned_to:'',due_date:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10),due_time:'',recurrence:'none',visibility:'household',category:'personal',priority:'normal'});async function load(){const[{data:t},people,{data:{user}}]=await Promise.all([supabase.from('ft_tasks').select('*').eq('household_id',household.id).order('due_date',{ascending:true,nullsFirst:false}).order('created_at'),loadMembers(household.id),supabase.auth.getUser()]);setTasks(t||[]);setMembers(people);setForm(f=>({...f,assigned_to:f.assigned_to||user.id}))}useEffect(()=>{load()},[household.id]);async function add(e){e.preventDefault();const{data:{user}}=await supabase.auth.getUser();const{error}=await supabase.from('ft_tasks').insert({...form,household_id:household.id,created_by:user.id,due_date:form.due_date||null,due_time:form.due_time||null});setMsg(error?error.message:'Task added.');if(!error){setForm({...form,title:'',due_time:''});load()}}async function complete(task){if(task.status==='complete'){const{error}=await supabase.from('ft_tasks').update({status:'open',completed_at:null}).eq('id',task.id);if(error)setMsg(error.message);else load()}else{const{error}=await supabase.rpc('ft_complete_task',{task_id:task.id});if(error)setMsg(error.message);else load()}}const today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);const visible=tasks.filter(t=>filter==='completed'?t.status==='complete':t.status==='open'&&(filter==='upcoming'?!t.due_date||t.due_date>today:!t.due_date||t.due_date<=today));const name=id=>members.find(m=>m.user_id===id)?.display_name||'Family member';return <div className="page"><p className="kicker">LIFE PLANNER</p><h1>Know the next right thing.</h1><p className="lead">Personal routines and shared responsibilities, in one calm place.</p><section className="panel"><form className="taskcomposer" onSubmit={add}><input className="tasktitle" required placeholder="What needs to be done?" value={form.title} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,title:e.target.value})}/><select value={form.assigned_to} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,assigned_to:e.target.value})}>{members.map(m=><option value={m.user_id} key={m.user_id}>{m.display_name||'Family member'}</option>)}</select><input type="date" value={form.due_date} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,due_date:e.target.value})}/><input type="time" value={form.due_time} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,due_time:e.target.value})}/><select value={form.category} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,category:e.target.value})}>{['personal','family','faith','health','home'].map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select><select value={form.recurrence} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,recurrence:e.target.value})}><option value="none">Does not repeat</option><option value="daily">Repeats daily</option><option value="weekly">Repeats weekly</option></select><select value={form.visibility} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,visibility:e.target.value})}><option value="household">Family can see</option><option value="private">Private</option></select><button className="primary">Add task</button></form><p className="privacyhint">Private tasks are visible only to the creator and assigned person.</p></section><div className="plannerbar">{[['today','Today'],['upcoming','Upcoming'],['completed','Completed']].map(x=><button className={filter===x[0]?'active':''} onClick={()=>setFilter(x[0])} key={x[0]}>{x[1]}</button>)}</div><div className="plannerlist">{visible.map(t=><article className={`planneritem ${t.status==='complete'?'done':''}`} key={t.id}><button onClick={()=>complete(t)}>✓</button><div><h3>{t.title}</h3><p>{t.category} · {name(t.assigned_to)}{t.recurrence!=='none'?` · ${t.recurrence}`:''}{t.visibility==='private'?' · Private':''}</p></div><time>{t.due_date?new Date(`${t.due_date}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(undefined,{month:'short',day:'numeric'}):'Anytime'}{t.due_time?` · ${new Date(`2000-01-01T${t.due_time}`).toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'numeric',minute:'2-digit'})}`:''}</time></article>)}{!visible.length&&<div className="plannerempty">Nothing here. Enjoy the breathing room.</div>}</div>{msg&&<p className="message status">{msg}</p>}</div>}
